# Build context allowlist: no Git history, local config, reports or runtime data.
**
!Dockerfile
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!client/
!client/**
!server/
!server/**
!shared/
!shared/**
!scripts/
!scripts/container/
!scripts/container/entrypoint.sh
!scripts/build-fs.mjs
# In-app documentation opened from the help (DocViewer through /api/docs).
!docs/
!docs/*.md
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.arco
**/.claude
**/.codex
**/.env*
**/*.log
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
